prompt:
你是独立的学科教师和页面质检员。第一张图是原题，第二张图是生成页面截图；HTML 源码也会附在文字中。核对题意、条件、推导、计算、单位、图示、结论、交互和离线可用性。图形的点位、形状、标注与公式必须一致；交互应同步更新相关视图。
本轮验收面向实际提供的桌面浏览器预览。只根据已提供截图、操作记录和源码指出具体问题；不要假设一个未测试的手机宽度并据此扣分或否决。若提供多张操作后截图，按说明核对对应步骤和控件变化；没有操作证据时，不得声称已实际点击或拖拽。

以刚读题、尚不知道解法的学生视角，检查可图解的关键步骤是否由可操作的图、分步状态、高亮、动画或前后对照承担主要解释，文字是否只保留必要的依据、公式和提示。若重要转折只剩长段文字，应指出具体哪一步需要什么视觉证据，并反映在页面效果、交互效果和教学效果评分中。可自然探索的参数应有合法范围与同步反馈；没有自然可变条件时，不因缺少滑块或动画而拒绝。出现学科错误、明显误导的图、裁切、缺字、不可读内容时不得通过。
检查操作与反馈的空间关系：如果一个滑块、拖拽点或按钮会同时改变多个图形、公式或数值，这些关键反馈应尽量位于控件附近或同一可见区域，并用一致的颜色、标记或高亮建立对应。学生操作时不应为了确认变化而反复大幅滚动，或在相距很远的区域寻找结果；页面较长时，可用局部同步反馈、分步切换等方式保持联系。若反馈位置明显妨碍观察，应在交互效果和教学效果评分中体现，并指出具体控件与反馈区域。
检查信息密度与标注可读性：图形复杂时应分层、分步或按需显示信息，避免把所有辅助线、点名、字母、公式和数值同时挤在一张图里。重点核对标签是否互相重叠、遮住图形或难以对应对象；若拥挤影响理解，应在页面效果和教学效果评分中体现，并指出需要疏解的区域及内容。

重点核对定义域、严格不等号、边界与退化条件；解析曲线不得有明显折角，控制点和标记点应满足同一方程。首次引入斜率、辅助量或控制参数时，须从原题条件交代来源、转化依据和合法范围。
先独立解出原题的每一个小问，再逐项核对页面给出的公式、数值、符号和取等条件。尤其检查页面是否真正给出要求的最终答案；只给滑块观察、把不可取到的边界极限说成最小值、或答案缺失，都不能判为合格。不要因为页面内部叙述自洽就默认数学正确。
检查向量箭头、下标等数学符号在截图中是否完整可读；若出现缺字方框、错误组合字符或重叠，指出具体标签及可替代的 SVG/HTML 排版方式。

针对已有失败页面，逐项查以下问题，不能用“图形看起来正确”替代核验：
1. 正文与脚本是否计算同一对象：斜率的两个端点及坐标差、长度与向量方向、面积区域、最终符号是否一致。用一个合法普通值及一个边界附近值代入核心表达式；若不一致，指出相冲突的两处及反例。不要把代码注释、自称“已验证”的文字或给定常量当成证明。
2. 所有小问是否完成：定点须有来源，极值须有推导和取等条件，值域须给完整集合。把当前滑块数值标成“范围”、只写“联立可得/继续求极值”、仅靠扫描猜答案，都属于答案或关键推导缺失。
3. 默认值、复位值、滑块两端、播放路径是否在题设可行域内；是否出现多数区间没有点线、NaN、Infinity或静默隐藏对象。检查非法默认值导致的空图，以及某些参数出现点重合、斜率无定义等退化。不能只检查截图对应的一个值。
4. 值域是否漏掉内部不可取点、分支或奇异值；端点逼近是否被误称为可以取到。独立从原题约束推导可行域，不能照抄页面的区间。
5. 图形比例是否支持结论：等长是否画得等长、正方形是否真为正方形、角度与曲线上的点是否准确；公式、图形、动态数值及最终静态答案应一致。原始 LaTeX、组合字符或未加载渲染器造成不可读公式时要指出。
6. 逐步操作是否真的展示条件转化：至少核对最难的一个转折是否有对应的图形高亮、局部图或状态变化。只有一幅动态图加最终答案、仅切换文字、提前给出未解释的控制量，都不能得到较高的教学效果分。

审核输入可能只含首屏截图和 HTML，未实际执行的交互应依据源码谨慎判断，不能声称已经拖拽或点击验证。只在有具体证据时写入 issues，说明“位置/控件、现象或反例、影响、修复方向”。严重数学错误或缺失整问时，正确性不能高于 2，必须 passed=false；页面美观不能抵消这些问题。不要将以上失败当作某一品牌固有缺陷，对所有生成模型使用同一标准。

按以下五项分别给 1–5 整数分（1=严重问题，3=部分达标，5=优秀）：
- problem_fidelity（一致性）：题目条件、对象、所求及示例状态与原题一致
- solution_correctness（正确性）：推导、计算、定义域、结论与图中数值正确
- page_quality（页面效果）：在本次实际提供的浏览器预览中，文字图形清晰、信息密度适当、标注不重叠、层级合理
- interaction_quality（交互效果）：交互量有清楚来历和合法范围，操作后图形、公式、数值同步，相关反馈便于就近观察；无需交互的题目可凭恰当的静态表达得高分
- teaching_effectiveness（教学效果）：刚读完题、尚不知道解法的学生，能从题设出发理解关键条件转化、每步依据和答案由来
另给整体教学网页一个 0–5 整数综合评分 overall_score：0=不合格，3=基本合格，5=优秀；综合评分独立判断，不机械平均五项分数。
以刚读完题、尚不知道解法的学生视角评价教学效果。按截图实际视觉阅读顺序检查：首屏是否先建立原题关系，而非抢先给出结论或不明来历的控件；左右并排时，控件旁是否先说明从题设如何得到参数与范围，不能用右侧靠后的说明代替。检查首次引入的参数、斜率、控制量、示例值是否从原题条件交代来源、变换依据和合法范围；如果关键非显然转化被跳过，学生必须先会解题才能理解页面，教学效果不能给高分，并在 issues 中写明缺口。合格判定独立于分数；题意或解答有实质错误、关键转化缺失、图形明显误导、严重不可读时不得通过。仅因简单题不需要交互，不应降低交互效果分或判不合格。只返回 JSON 对象：{"passed":布尔值,"overall_score":0到5整数,"scores":{"problem_fidelity":1到5整数,"solution_correctness":1到5整数,"page_quality":1到5整数,"interaction_quality":1到5整数,"teaching_effectiveness":1到5整数},"summary":"简短结论","issues":["可执行的具体修改意见"]}。不通过时 issues 至少一项。

HTML 源码：
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>二次函数值域探究</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f4f8fe 0%, #edf3fb 100%);
    color: #1e293b;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .app {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 22px 24px 34px;
  }
  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.3vw, 32px);
    letter-spacing: .2px;
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  .sub {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .answer-chip {
    flex: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    font-weight: 750;
    color: #475569;
    background: #e2e8f0;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    transition: background .25s, color .25s, border .25s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .answer-chip.revealed {
    background: #dcfce7;
    color: #166534;
    border-color: #86efac;
  }
  .layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.58fr) minmax(320px, .82fr);
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .visual-panel {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 16px 16px 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.07);
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }
  .graph-wrap { width: 100%; }
  #mainSvg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .control-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 12px;
    padding: 14px 8px 4px;
  }
  .control-row label { font-weight: 750; color: #334155; }
  #xSlider {
    flex: 1 1 230px;
    min-width: 170px;
    accent-color: #ea580c;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .readout {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 158px;
    font-weight: 750;
    color: #334155;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  button {
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: #334155;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
    transition: background .2s, border .2s, transform .1s;
  }
  button:hover { background: #eff6ff; border-color: #93c5fd; }
  button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
  #vertexBtn { border-color: #fbbf24; background: #fffbeb; color: #92400e; }
  #playBtn { border-color: #93c5fd; background: #eff6ff; color: #1d4ed8; }
  .side-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .step-buttons {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .step-btn {
    padding: 10px 8px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #dbe4ef;
    color: #475569;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15,23,42,.03);
  }
  .step-btn.active {
    background: #2563eb;
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #2563eb;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(37,99,235,.23);
  }
  .card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.05);
    min-height: 300px;
  }
  .card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  .card p {
    margin: 10px 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #334155;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .card b { color: #0f172a; }
  .hint {
    font-size: 14px !important;
    color: #64748b !important;
    border-left: 3px solid #bfdbfe;
    padding-left: 10px;
  }
  .live-box {
    margin: 12px 0;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #334155;
  }
  .derivation {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e7eef7;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  .final-box {
    margin: 14px 0;
    padding: 14px 12px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #166534;
    background: #dcfce7;
    border: 1px solid #86efac;
    letter-spacing: .3px;
  }
  .range-panel {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding: 14px 16px 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.05);
  }
  .range-title {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .range-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: #475569;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .range-label.strong {
    font-weight: 800;
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }
  .range-caption {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: #64748b;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .range-formula {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1d4ed8;
    margin-top: -2px;
    letter-spacing: .5px;
  }
  .svg-label {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
    paint-order: stroke;
    stroke: #fff;
    stroke-width: 4px;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .svg-label.strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .svg-label.teal { fill: #0f766e; }
  .svg-label.orange { fill: #c2410c; }
  .svg-label.purple { fill: #6d28d9; }
  .svg-note {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: #94a3b8;
    paint-order: stroke;
    stroke: #fff;
    stroke-width: 3px;
  }
  .axis-name {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #64748b;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .tick-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: #7b8794;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .step-buttons { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .app { padding: 14px; }
    .topbar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .step-buttons { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .control-row { align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <header class="topbar">
    <div>
      <h1>函数 y = −x<sup>2</sup> + 2x − 14 的值域</h1>
      <p class="sub">拖动图象上的点 P，观察 y 能取到哪些值</p>
    </div>
    <div class="answer-chip" id="answerChip">值域：待探索</div>
  </header>

  <main class="layout">
    <section class="visual-panel">
      <div class="graph-wrap">
        <svg id="mainSvg" viewBox="0 0 860 560" role="img" aria-label="二次函数图象与当前点">
          <defs>
            <marker id="axisArrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto" markerUnits="strokeWidth">
              <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z" fill="#7b8794"></path>
            </marker>
            <marker id="extendArrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="7" refY="4.5" orient="auto" markerUnits="strokeWidth">
              <path d="M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 Z" fill="#2563eb"></path>
            </marker>
          </defs>

          <rect x="0" y="0" width="860" height="560" fill="#ffffff" rx="16"></rect>
          <g id="gridLayer"></g>
          <g id="axesLayer"></g>

          <rect id="rangeBand" x="80" y="266" width="720" height="214" fill="#0f766e" fill-opacity="0.08" opacity="0"></rect>

          <path id="parabolaPath" d="" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="3.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
          <g id="extendLayer" opacity="0.96"></g>

          <g id="guideLayer">
            <line id="axisSym" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 6" opacity="0"></line>
            <text id="axisSymLabel" class="svg-label teal" text-anchor="start" opacity="0">对称轴 x = 1</text>

            <line id="vertexLevel" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="6 6" opacity="0"></line>
            <text id="vertexLevelLabel" class="svg-label teal" text-anchor="start" opacity="0">y = −13</text>

            <circle id="vertexDot" r="7" fill="#0f766e" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0"></circle>
            <text id="vertexLabel" class="svg-label teal strong" text-anchor="end" opacity="0">顶点 (1, −13)</text>

            <line id="baseLine" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0"></line>
            <line id="dropLine" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0"></line>
            <text id="dropLabel" class="svg-label purple strong" text-anchor="end" opacity="0"></text>

            <line id="dSegment" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0"></line>
            <text id="dLabel" class="svg-label orange strong" text-anchor="middle" opacity="0"></text>
          </g>

          <g id="pointLayer">
            <line id="verticalGuide" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 5"></line>
            <circle id="xTickDot" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
            <circle id="pointDot" r="7" fill="#ea580c" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5"></circle>
            <text id="pointLabel" class="svg-label orange strong" text-anchor="start"></text>
          </g>

          <text x="805" y="512" class="svg-note" text-anchor="end">局部显示窗口：x 取全体实数，图象向左右及下方继续延伸</text>
          <text x="805" y="530" class="svg-note" text-anchor="end">（x 轴与 y 轴显示比例不同）</text>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="control-row">
        <label for="xSlider">拖动 x</label>
        <input id="xSlider" type="range" min="-2.5" max="4.5" step="0.01" value="2">
        <div class="readout">
          <span id="xReadout"></span>
          <span id="yReadout"></span>
        </div>
        <button id="vertexBtn" type="button">回到顶点 x = 1</button>
        <button id="playBtn" type="button">自动扫描</button>
        <button id="resetBtn" type="button">复位</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="side-panel">
      <div class="step-buttons" id="stepButtons">
        <button class="step-btn active" data-step="0" type="button">① 题设</button>
        <button class="step-btn" data-step="1" type="button">② 配方</button>
        <button class="step-btn" data-step="2" type="button">③ 非负平方</button>
        <button class="step-btn" data-step="3" type="button">④ 值域</button>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 id="stepTitle"></h2>
        <div id="stepBody"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="range-panel" id="rangePanel" style="display:none">
        <div class="range-title">数轴上的值域</div>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 360 96" width="100%" aria-label="值域数轴">
          <line x1="34" y1="44" x2="332" y2="44" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2.5"></line>
          <polygon points="22,44 38,37 38,51" fill="#2b6de5"></polygon>
          <line x1="38" y1="44" x2="205" y2="44" stroke="#2b6de5" stroke-width="10" opacity="0.18" stroke-linecap="round"></line>
          <circle cx="205" cy="44" r="8" fill="#2b6de5" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5"></circle>
          <text x="205" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="range-label strong">−13</text>
          <text x="332" y="76" text-anchor="end" class="range-label">0</text>
          <text x="148" y="22" text-anchor="middle" class="range-caption">向左无限延伸，−13 可取到</text>
          <circle id="rangeCurrentDot" cx="0" cy="44" r="5" fill="#ea580c" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2" opacity="0"></circle>
        </svg>
        <div class="range-formula">(−∞, −13]</div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>
</div>

<script>
(function () {
  const plot = {
    left: 80,
    right: 800,
    top: 50,
    bottom: 480,
    xMin: -3,
    xMax: 5,
    yMin: -30,
    yMax: 4
  };

  function f(x) {
    return -x * x + 2 * x - 14;
  }

  function sx(x) {
    return plot.left + (x - plot.xMin) / (plot.xMax - plot.xMin) * (plot.right - plot.left);
  }

  function sy(y) {
    return plot.top + (plot.yMax - y) / (plot.yMax - plot.yMin) * (plot.bottom - plot.top);
  }

  function fmt(n, digits) {
    if (digits === undefined) digits = 2;
    return Number(n).toFixed(digits).replace("-", "−");
  }

  function rangeX(y) {
    return 38 + (y + 30) / 30 * (332 - 38);
  }

  const state = {
    step: 0,
    x: 2,
    playing: false
  };

  const xSlider = document.getElementById("xSlider");
  const xReadout = document.getElementById("xReadout");
  const yReadout = document.getElementById("yReadout");
  const vertexBtn = document.getElementById("vertexBtn");
  const playBtn = document.getElementById("playBtn");
  const resetBtn = document.getElementById("resetBtn");
  const stepTitle = document.getElementById("stepTitle");
  const stepBody = document.getElementById("stepBody");
  const answerChip = document.getElementById("answerChip");
  const rangePanel = document.getElementById("rangePanel");
  const rangeCurrentDot = document.getElementById("rangeCurrentDot");

  const axisSym = document.getElementById("axisSym");
  const axisSymLabel = document.getElementById("axisSymLabel");
  const vertexLevel = document.getElementById("vertexLevel");
  const vertexLevelLabel = document.getElementById("vertexLevelLabel");
  const vertexDot = document.getElementById("vertexDot");
  const vertexLabel = document.getElementById("vertexLabel");
  const baseLine = document.getElementById("baseLine");
  const dropLine = document.getElementById("dropLine");
  const dropLabel = document.getElementById("dropLabel");
  const dSegment = document.getElementById("dSegment");
  const dLabel = document.getElementById("dLabel");
  const rangeBand = document.getElementById("rangeBand");

  const verticalGuide = document.getElementById("verticalGuide");
  const xTickDot = document.getElementById("xTickDot");
  const pointDot = document.getElementById("pointDot");
  const pointLabel = document.getElementById("pointLabel");

  function show(el, visible) {
    if (!el) return;
    el.style.transition = "opacity .25s ease";
    el.style.opacity = visible ? "1" : "0";
  }

  function drawStatic() {
    const gridLayer = document.getElementById("gridLayer");
    let grid = "";

    for (let x = -3; x <= 5; x++) {
      const xx = sx(x);
      grid += '<line x1="' + xx + '" y1="' + plot.top + '" x2="' + xx + '" y2="' + plot.bottom + '" stroke="#e8eef7" stroke-width="1"/>';
    }
    for (let y = -30; y <= 0; y += 5) {
      const yy = sy(y);
      grid += '<line x1="' + plot.left + '" y1="' + yy + '" x2="' + plot.right + '" y2="' + yy + '" stroke="#e8eef7" stroke-width="1"/>';
    }
    gridLayer.innerHTML = grid;

    const axesLayer = document.getElementById("axesLayer");
    const x0 = sx(0);
    const y0 = sy(0);
    let axes = "";

    axes += '<line x1="' + plot.left + '" y1="' + y0 + '" x2="' + plot.right + '" y2="' + y0 + '" stroke="#8a98aa" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#axisArrow)"/>';
    axes += '<line x1="' + x0 + '" y1="' + plot.bottom + '" x2="' + x0 + '" y2="' + plot.top + '" stroke="#8a98aa" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#axisArrow)"/>';

    for (let x = -3; x <= 5; x++) {
      const xx = sx(x);
      axes += '<line x1="' + xx + '" y1="' + (y0 - 4) + '" x2="' + xx + '" y2="' + (y0 + 4) + '" stroke="#8a98aa" stroke-width="1.3"/>';
      axes += '<text x="' + xx + '" y="' + (y0 + 21) + '" text-anchor="middle" class="tick-label">' + (x === 0 ? "0" : x) + '</text>';
    }

    for (let y = -30; y <= -5; y += 5) {
      const yy = sy(y);
      axes += '<line x1="' + (x0 - 4) + '" y1="' + yy + '" x2="' + (x0 + 4) + '" y2="' + yy + '" stroke="#8a98aa" stroke-width="1.3"/>';
      axes += '<text x="' + (x0 - 9) + '" y="' + (yy + 4) + '" text-anchor="end" class="tick-label">' + String(y).replace("-", "−") + '</text>';
    }

    axes += '<text x="' + (plot.right + 18) + '" y="' + (y0 + 5) + '" class="axis-name" text-anchor="start">x</text>';
    axes += '<text x="' + (x0 + 10) + '" y="' + (plot.top + 13) + '" class="axis-name">y</text>';
    axesLayer.innerHTML = axes;

    let pathData = "";
    const N = 420;
    for (let i = 0; i <= N; i++) {
      const x = plot.xMin + (plot.xMax - plot.xMin) * i / N;
      const px = sx(x);
      const py = sy(f(x));
      pathData += (i === 0 ? "M" : "L") + px.toFixed(2) + "," + py.toFixed(2) + " ";
    }
    document.getElementById("parabolaPath").setAttribute("d", pathData);

    const leftEndX = sx(plot.xMin);
    const leftEndY = sy(f(plot.xMin));
    const rightEndX = sx(plot.xMax);
    const rightEndY = sy(f(plot.xMax));
    const extendLayer = document.getElementById("extendLayer");
    extendLayer.innerHTML =
      '<path d="M ' + (leftEndX + 5) + ' ' + (leftEndY - 2) + ' L ' + (leftEndX - 14) + ' ' + (leftEndY + 11) + '" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#extendArrow)"/>' +
      '<path d="M ' + (rightEndX - 5) + ' ' + (rightEndY - 2) + ' L ' + (rightEndX + 14) + ' ' + (rightEndY + 11) + '" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round" marker-end="url(#extendArrow)"/>' +
      '<text x="' + sx(1) + '" y="' + (plot.bottom - 6) + '" text-anchor="middle" class="svg-note">曲线继续向下延伸</text>';

    rangeBand.setAttribute("x", plot.left);
    rangeBand.setAttribute("y", sy(-13));
    rangeBand.setAttribute("width", plot.right - plot.left);
    rangeBand.setAttribute("height", sy(-30) - sy(-13));

    axisSym.setAttribute("x1", sx(1));
    axisSym.setAttribute("x2", sx(1));
    axisSym.setAttribute("y1", plot.top + 14);
    axisSym.setAttribute("y2", plot.bottom - 10);

    axisSymLabel.setAttribute("x", sx(1) + 8);
    axisSymLabel.setAttribute("y", plot.top + 22);

    vertexLevel.setAttribute("x1", plot.left);
    vertexLevel.setAttribute("x2", plot.right);
    vertexLevel.setAttribute("y1", sy(-13));
    vertexLevel.setAttribute("y2", sy(-13));

    vertexLevelLabel.setAttribute("x", plot.left + 10);
    vertexLevelLabel.setAttribute("y", sy(-13) - 8);

    vertexDot.setAttribute("cx", sx(1));
    vertexDot.setAttribute("cy", sy(-13));

    vertexLabel.setAttribute("x", sx(1) - 13);
    vertexLabel.setAttribute("y", sy(-13) - 12);

    baseLine.setAttribute("y1", sy(-13));
    baseLine.setAttribute("y2", sy(-13));
    baseLine.setAttribute("x1", sx(1));

    dSegment.setAttribute("y1", sy(0));
    dSegment.setAttribute("y2", sy(0));
    dSegment.setAttribute("x1", sx(1));

    xTickDot.setAttribute("cy", sy(0));
  }

  function updateCard(x, y, d, d2) {
    let title = "";
    let body = "";

    if (state.step === 0) {
      title = "① 观察：点 P 怎样改变 y";
      body =
        '<p>拖动滑块，让图象上的点 <b>P</b> 移动。P 的纵坐标就是函数值 <b>y</b>。</p>' +
        '<div class="live-box">x = <b>' + fmt(x) + '</b> &nbsp;→&nbsp; y = <b>' + fmt(y) + '</b></div>' +
        '<p class="hint">先观察 y 有没有可能比图上的最高点更大。</p>';
    } else if (state.step === 1) {
      title = "② 配方：找到最高点";
      body =
        '<p>把函数改写成顶点式，就能直接读出顶点。</p>' +
        '<div class="derivation">' +
          'y = −x<sup>2</sup> + 2x − 14<br>' +
          '= −(x<sup>2</sup> − 2x) − 14<br>' +
          '= −[(x − 1)<sup>2</sup> − 1] − 14<br>' +
          '= −(x − 1)<sup>2</sup> − 13' +
        '</div>' +
        '<p>图上顶点是 <b>(1, −13)</b>，对称轴是 <b>x = 1</b>。</p>';
    } else if (state.step === 2) {
      title = "③ 把平方看成“离 1 的距离”";
      body =
        '<p>令 d = |x − 1|。顶点水平线上的橙色线段表示 d，紫色竖直下降量表示 d<sup>2</sup>。</p>' +
        '<div class="derivation">y = −(x − 1)<sup>2</sup> − 13 = −13 − d<sup>2</sup></div>' +
        '<div class="live-box">d = <b>' + fmt(d) + '</b> &nbsp; d<sup>2</sup> = <b>' + fmt(d2) + '</b> &nbsp; y = <b>' + fmt(y) + '</b></div>' +
        '<p class="hint">平方 d<sup>2</sup> 永远 ≥ 0，所以 y 只能等于 −13 再减去一个非负数。</p>';
    } else {
      title = "④ 得出值域";
      body =
        '<p>无论 x 取什么值，都有 y = −13 − d<sup>2</sup> ≤ −13。并且当 x 取遍全体实数时，d = |x − 1| 取遍 [0, ∞)，所以 y 取遍 (−∞, −13]。</p>' +
        '<div class="derivation">对任意 t ≤ −13，令 d = √(−13 − t)，取 x = 1 ± d，则 y = −13 − d<sup>2</sup> = t。</div>' +
        '<div class="live-box">当前 y = <b>' + fmt(y) + '</b>；当 x = 1 时，y = <b>−13</b>。</div>' +
        '<div class="final-box">值域：y ∈ (−∞, −13]</div>' +
        '<p class="hint">−13 可取到；−∞ 只是向下无限延伸，不是能取到的数。</p>';
    }

    stepTitle.textContent = title;
    stepBody.innerHTML = body;
  }

  function render() {
    const x = state.x;
    const y = f(x);
    const d = Math.abs(x - 1);
    const d2 = d * d;
    const xPix = sx(x);
    const yPix = sy(y);

    xSlider.value = x;
    xReadout.textContent = "x = " + fmt(x);
    yReadout.textContent = "y = " + fmt(y);

    pointDot.setAttribute("cx", xPix);
    pointDot.setAttribute("cy", yPix);

    verticalGuide.setAttribute("x1", xPix);
    verticalGuide.setAttribute("x2", xPix);
    verticalGuide.setAttribute("y1", yPix);
    verticalGuide.setAttribute("y2", sy(0));

    xTickDot.setAttribute("cx", xPix);

    const labelRight = x <= 3.6;
    pointLabel.setAttribute("x", xPix + (labelRight ? 12 : -12));
    pointLabel.setAttribute("y", yPix - 12);
    pointLabel.setAttribute("text-anchor", labelRight ? "start" : "end");
    pointLabel.textContent = "P (" + fmt(x) + ", " + fmt(y) + ")";

    baseLine.setAttribute("x2", xPix);
    dropLine.setAttribute("x1", xPix);
    dropLine.setAttribute("x2", xPix);
    dropLine.setAttribute("y1", sy(-13));
    dropLine.setAttribute("y2", yPix);

    const midX = (sx(1) + xPix) / 2;
    const dSmall = d < 0.8;
    dLabel.setAttribute("x", dSmall ? (x >= 1 ? xPix + 12 : xPix - 12) : midX);
    dLabel.setAttribute("text-anchor", dSmall ? (x >= 1 ? "start" : "end") : "middle");
    dLabel.setAttribute("y", sy(-13) + (dSmall ? 32 : -10));
    dLabel.textContent = "d = " + fmt(d);

    dropLabel.setAttribute("x", xPix + (x >= 1 ? -12 : 12));
    dropLabel.setAttribute("y", (sy(-13) + yPix) / 2 + 5);
    dropLabel.setAttribute("text-anchor", x >= 1 ? "end" : "start");
    dropLabel.textContent = "d² = " + fmt(d2);

    dSegment.setAttribute("x2", xPix);

    show(axisSym, state.step >= 1);
    show(axisSymLabel, state.step >= 1);
    show(vertexLevel, state.step >= 1);
    show(vertexLevelLabel, state.step >= 1);
    show(vertexDot, state.step >= 1);
    show(vertexLabel, state.step >= 1);

    show(baseLine, state.step >= 2);
    show(dropLine, state.step >= 2);
    show(dropLabel, state.step >= 2);
    show(dSegment, false);
    show(dLabel, state.step >= 2);

    show(rangeBand, state.step >= 3);

    rangePanel.style.display = state.step >= 3 ? "block" : "none";
    rangeCurrentDot.setAttribute("cx", rangeX(y));
    rangeCurrentDot.style.opacity = state.step >= 3 ? "1" : "0";

    updateCard(x, y, d, d2);

    if (state.step === 0) {
      answerChip.textContent = "值域：待探索";
      answerChip.classList.remove("revealed");
    } else if (state.step === 1) {
      answerChip.textContent = "顶点：最高点 (1, −13)";
      answerChip.classList.remove("revealed");
    } else if (state.step === 2) {
      answerChip.textContent = "关键：y = −13 − d²";
      answerChip.classList.remove("revealed");
    } else {
      answerChip.textContent = "值域：(−∞, −13]";
      answerChip.classList.add("revealed");
    }

    document.querySelectorAll(".step-btn").forEach(function (btn) {
      btn.classList.toggle("active", Number(btn.dataset.step) === state.step);
    });
  }

  function setX(value, fromPlay) {
    state.x = Math.max(-2.5, Math.min(4.5, value));
    if (fromPlay) {
      xSlider.value = state.x;
    }
    render();
  }

  let playRAF = null;
  let playStart = 0;
  let playPhase = 0;

  function stopPlay() {
    if (state.playing) {
      state.playing = false;
      if (playRAF) {
        cancelAnimationFrame(playRAF);
        playRAF = null;
      }
    }
    playBtn.textContent = "自动扫描";
  }

  function animatePlay(now) {
    if (!state.playing) return;
    const elapsed = (now - playStart) / 1000;
    const x = 1 + 3 * Math.sin(playPhase + elapsed * 1.15);
    setX(x, true);
    playRAF = requestAnimationFrame(animatePlay);
  }

  function startPlay() {
    state.playing = true;
    playBtn.textContent = "暂停扫描";
    playStart = performance.now();
    const ratio = Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, (state.x - 1) / 3));
    playPhase = Math.asin(ratio);
    playRAF = requestAnimationFrame(animatePlay);
  }

  xSlider.addEventListener("input", function () {
    stopPlay();
    setX(parseFloat(xSlider.value), false);
  });

  vertexBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
    stopPlay();
    setX(1, false);
  });

  playBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
    if (state.playing) {
      stopPlay();
    } else {
      startPlay();
    }
  });

  resetBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
    stopPlay();
    state.step = 0;
    state.x = 2;
    render();
  });

  document.querySelectorAll(".step-btn").forEach(function (btn) {
    btn.addEventListener("click", function () {
      stopPlay();
      state.step = Number(btn.dataset.step);
      render();
    });
  });

  drawStatic();
  render();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
